c-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§3.4, pp. 68–71; scans 76–79"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in Q,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p,q\\in Q,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。扩张转移见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 表示布尔异或，并在断言中展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}state\\text{-}distinguishability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Dist}_M(p,q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;((\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\in F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\notin F)\\lor(\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\notin F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\in F))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}state\\text{-}distinguishability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Dist}_M(p,q)\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;((\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\in F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\notin F)\\lor(\\widehat\\delta_M(p,w)\\notin F\\land\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\in F))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}state\\text{-}distinguishability}\\vdash\nD^M_0\\coloneqq(F\\times(Q\\setminus F))\\cup((Q\\setminus F)\\times F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}state\\text{-}distinguishability}\\vdash\nD^M_0\\coloneqq(F\\times(Q\\setminus F))\\cup((Q\\setminus F)\\times F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}state\\text{-}distinguishability}\\vdash\nD^M_{n+1}\\coloneqq D^M_n\\cup\\{(p,q)\\in Q^2:\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\delta(p,a),\\delta(q,a))\\in D^M_n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}state\\text{-}distinguishability}\\vdash\nD^M_{n+1}\\coloneqq D^M_n\\cup\\{(p,q)\\in Q^2:\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;(\\delta(p,a),\\delta(q,a))\\in D^M_n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}state\\text{-}distinguishability}\\vdash\np\\sim_Mq\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Dist}_M(p,q),\\qquad[p]_M\\coloneqq\\{q\\in Q:p\\sim_Mq\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}state\\text{-}distinguishability}\\vdash\np\\sim_Mq\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Dist}_M(p,q),\\qquad[p]_M\\coloneqq\\{q\\in Q:p\\sim_Mq\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>递归发生在自然数阶段上。D₀ 用空词区分，后继阶段把一个输入字符接到已知区分词之前；这给出填表算法的明确含义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数